msgstr "5 Jun 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Support for the Store instruction on IBM&reg; QPUs** - Now you can "
"simplify complex classical computations in your quantum circuits with the "
"Store instruction. [*Read more*](#store-instruction)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sokongan untuk arahan Store pada QPU IBM&reg;** - Kini anda boleh "
"memudahkan pengiraan klasik yang kompleks dalam Circuit kuantum anda dengan "
"arahan Store. [*Baca lebih lanjut*](#store-instruction)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "29 May 2026\n"
msgstr "29 Mei 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Qiskit Code Assistant service discontinued** - The preview service has "
"been discontinued and the Visual Studio Code and JupyterLab extensions have "
"been archived. [*Read more*](#qca-sunset)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Perkhidmatan Pembantu Kod Qiskit dihentikan** - Perkhidmatan pratonton "
"telah dihentikan dan sambungan Visual Studio Code dan JupyterLab telah "
"diarkibkan. [*Baca lebih lanjut*](#qca-sunset)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "28 May 2026\n"
msgstr "28 Mei 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New Classroom Accounts** - Professors can now request a Classroom Account "
"to manage and facilitate access for their students. With Classroom Accounts,"
" students can use Open Plan resources without needing to provide personal "
"credit card information. [*Read more*](#classroom-accounts)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Akaun Bilik Darjah Baharu** - Profesor kini boleh memohon Akaun Bilik "
"Darjah untuk mengurus dan memudahkan akses bagi pelajar mereka. Dengan Akaun"
" Bilik Darjah, pelajar boleh menggunakan sumber Pelan Terbuka tanpa perlu "
"memberikan maklumat kad kredit peribadi. [*Baca lebih lanjut*](#classroom-"
"accounts)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "18 May 2026\n"
msgstr "18 Mei 2026\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- **Introducing the Executor primitive** - We're excited to announce the release of the new `Executor` primitive and a new version of the noise-learning helper class, `NoiseLearnerV3`, both of which were first previewed at QDC 2025. [*Read more*](#executor-primitive)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- **Memperkenalkan primitif Executor** - Kami dengan gembira mengumumkan keluaran primitif `Executor` baharu dan versi baharu kelas pembantu pembelajaran hingar, `NoiseLearnerV3`, yang kedua-duanya pertama kali dipratonton di QDC 2025. [*Baca lebih lanjut*](#executor-primitive)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

