#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Platform {#ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Platform {#ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section summarizes the recent enhancements and new features for the new"
" [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian ini meringkaskan penambahbaikan terkini dan ciri baharu untuk [IBM "
"Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) yang baru.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "May 2026 {#may-2026}"
msgstr "Mei 2026 {#may-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-instruction\"></span>\n"
"- **Support for the [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction on IBM&reg; QPUs** - Now you can simplify complex classical computations in your quantum circuits with the Store instruction.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"store-instruction\"></span>\n"
"- **Sokongan untuk arahan [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) pada QPU IBM&reg;** - Kini anda boleh memudahkan pengiraan klasik yang kompleks dalam Circuit kuantum anda dengan arahan Store.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute a classical expression mid-circuit and save the result to a variable"
" or register, which can then immediately control subsequent quantum gates.  "
"Instead of deeply nested inline expressions, you can break computations into"
" named intermediate steps, so that complex classical feedback logic is "
"easier to read and maintain. **Common use cases** include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kira ungkapan klasik di pertengahan Circuit dan simpan hasilnya ke dalam "
"pemboleh ubah atau daftar, yang kemudian boleh terus mengawal Gate kuantum "
"seterusnya. Daripada ungkapan berselirat yang bersarang dalam, anda boleh "
"memecahkan pengiraan kepada langkah perantaraan yang dinamakan, supaya logik"
" maklum balas klasik yang kompleks lebih mudah dibaca dan diselenggara. "
"**Kes penggunaan biasa** termasuk yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dynamic circuits with mid-circuit measurements and classical feedback  \n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit dinamik dengan pengukuran pertengahan Circuit dan maklum balas "
"klasik  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Long-range entanglement preparation  \n"
msgstr "Penyediaan kerjasama jarak jauh  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Complex conditional logic based on measurement outcomes\n"
msgstr "Logik bersyarat kompleks berdasarkan hasil pengukuran\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    To use the store instruction, first ensure you're running the latest "
"version of `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime`), then see the [documentation](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-"
"control-flow#store) for more information and an example.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Untuk menggunakan arahan store, pastikan anda menjalankan versi terbaru "
"`qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-runtime`), kemudian "
"lihat [dokumentasi](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow#store) "
"untuk maklumat lanjut dan contoh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    *Note that before submitting jobs, you should verify compatibility with "
"each primitive's options in the documentation*: [Sampler "
"options](/guides/sampler-options) | [Estimator options](/guides/estimator-"
"options) | [Executor options](/guides/executor-options)\n"
msgstr ""
"    *Ambil perhatian bahawa sebelum menghantar kerja, anda perlu mengesahkan"
" keserasian dengan pilihan setiap primitif dalam dokumentasi*: [Pilihan "
"Sampler](/guides/sampler-options) | [Pilihan Estimator](/guides/estimator-"
"options) | [Pilihan Executor](/guides/executor-options)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"classroom-accounts\"></span>\n"
"- **New Classroom Accounts**: Professors can now request a [Classroom Account](/guides/classroom-accounts) to manage and facilitate access for their students. With Classroom Accounts, students can use Open Plan resources without needing to provide personal credit card information.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"classroom-accounts\"></span>\n"
"- **Akaun Bilik Darjah Baharu**: Profesor kini boleh memohon [Akaun Bilik Darjah](/guides/classroom-accounts) untuk mengurus dan memudahkan akses bagi pelajar mereka. Dengan Akaun Bilik Darjah, pelajar boleh menggunakan sumber Pelan Terbuka tanpa perlu memberikan maklumat kad kredit peribadi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Previous updates (2026)**\">\n"
"  ### April 2026\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Kemas kini sebelumnya (2026)**\">\n"
"  ### April 2026\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New export options now available in IBM Quantum**: Introducing new export "
"capabilities that make it easier for account administrators to analyze, "
"share, and work with their data.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pilihan eksport baharu kini tersedia dalam IBM Quantum**: Memperkenalkan "
"keupayaan eksport baharu yang memudahkan pentadbir akaun untuk menganalisis,"
" berkongsi, dan bekerja dengan data mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "New in the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page:\n"
msgstr ""
"Baharu dalam halaman [Analitik](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can now export charts in SVG or PNG format.\n"
msgstr "Anda kini boleh mengeksport carta dalam format SVG atau PNG.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can export all analytics data, including the data behind the charts, as "
"CSV.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh mengeksport semua data analitik, termasuk data di sebalik carta, "
"sebagai CSV.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of each card on the "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"      Cari menu eksport di penjuru kanan atas setiap kad pada halaman.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"New in the [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) page:\n"
msgstr ""
"Baharu dalam halaman [Pengurusan "
"akses](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Export both the Users table and the Access Groups table in CSV format.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eksport kedua-dua jadual Pengguna dan jadual Kumpulan Akses dalam format "
"CSV.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of the table.\n"
msgstr "      Cari menu eksport di penjuru kanan atas jadual.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New resources and hardware for Open Plan users**: The [IBM Quantum Open "
"Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) now features new learning "
"resources, new hardware, and a special one-time promotion for eligible "
"users.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sumber dan perkakasan baharu untuk pengguna Pelan Terbuka**: [Pelan "
"Terbuka IBM Quantum](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) kini menampilkan "
"sumber pembelajaran baharu, perkakasan baharu, dan promosi sekali sahaja "
"yang istimewa untuk pengguna yang layak.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new course, [Designing and leading quantum "
"projects](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), is now "
"available. This course covers key topics for users looking to develop or "
"secure funding for a quantum project, including early-stage planning, team "
"roles and responsibilities, identifying meaningful use cases, defining "
"measures of success, and a guide to grant writing best practices.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus baharu, [Mereka bentuk dan memimpin projek "
"kuantum](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), kini "
"tersedia. Kursus ini merangkumi topik penting bagi pengguna yang ingin "
"membangunkan atau mendapatkan pembiayaan untuk projek kuantum, termasuk "
"perancangan peringkat awal, peranan dan tanggungjawab pasukan, mengenal "
"pasti kes penggunaan yang bermakna, mentakrifkan ukuran kejayaan, dan "
"panduan amalan terbaik penulisan geran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Heron r2 "
"[`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;one"
" of our highest-performing quantum computers&mdash;is now available to all "
"Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Heron r2 "
"[`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;salah"
" satu komputer kuantum kami yang paling berprestasi&mdash;kini tersedia "
"kepada semua pengguna Pelan Terbuka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log 20 minutes of compute in any 12-month period and you can opt in to a "
"special one-time offer: 180 minutes for the next 12 months.\n"
msgstr ""
"Log 20 minit pengiraan dalam mana-mana tempoh 12 bulan dan anda boleh "
"memilih untuk menyertai tawaran sekali sahaja yang istimewa: 180 minit untuk"
" 12 bulan akan datang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      With expanded runtime and new educational resources, users can run "
"everything from introductory circuits to advanced hybrid workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"      Dengan masa larian yang diperluaskan dan sumber pendidikan baharu, "
"pengguna boleh menjalankan segala-galanya daripada Circuit pengenalan kepada"
" alur kerja hibrid lanjutan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      These efforts reflect our commitment to open access, open education, "
"and open science in quantum computing. Read more: [Doubling down on open-"
"access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-"
"updates)\n"
msgstr ""
"      Usaha-usaha ini mencerminkan komitmen kami terhadap akses terbuka, "
"pendidikan terbuka, dan sains terbuka dalam pengkomputeran kuantum. Baca "
"lebih lanjut: [Menggandakan usaha terhadap pengkomputeran kuantum akses "
"terbuka](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Upcoming discontinuation of Qiskit Code Assistant service\n"
msgstr "  #### Penghentian perkhidmatan Pembantu Kod Qiskit yang akan datang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  On 29 May 2026, IBM Quantum will discontinue the preview Qiskit Code "
"Assistant service and archive the supporting extensions for Visual Studio "
"Code and JupyterLab.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Pada 29 Mei 2026, IBM Quantum akan menghentikan perkhidmatan pratonton "
"Pembantu Kod Qiskit dan mengarkibkan sambungan sokongan untuk Visual Studio "
"Code dan JupyterLab.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Based on feedback and usage patterns, more users are running Qiskit Code "
"Assistant models locally and working in editor integrations that are already"
" part of their development workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Berdasarkan maklum balas dan corak penggunaan, lebih ramai pengguna "
"menjalankan model Pembantu Kod Qiskit secara tempatan dan bekerja dalam "
"integrasi editor yang sudah menjadi sebahagian daripada aliran kerja "
"pembangunan mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Qiskit Code Assistant models will remain available for local use. To "
"continue using them, move to a local deployment and a community-supported "
"editor integration or other local tooling.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Model Pembantu Kod Qiskit akan kekal tersedia untuk kegunaan tempatan. "
"Untuk terus menggunakannya, beralih kepada penyebaran tempatan dan integrasi"
" editor yang disokong komuniti atau alatan tempatan lain.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  For setup guidance, see the [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-"
"assistant) guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Untuk panduan persediaan, lihat panduan [Pembantu Kod "
"Qiskit](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Nighthawk arrives in the EU\n"
msgstr "  #### Nighthawk tiba di EU\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! "
"It is the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 QPU in the EU (`eu-de` region) and "
"the second Nighthawk in our global fleet, after "
"[`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) in "
"the US (`us-east` region). `ibm_berlin` features faster two-qubit gates than"
" `ibm_miami` (68 ns versus 138 ns, median) while maintaining similar fleet-"
"leading coherence (T$_1$ of ~350 &#181;s).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Pelan Premium dan Flex kini mempunyai akses awal kepada "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! "
"Ia merupakan QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 pertama di EU (rantau `eu-de`) dan"
" Nighthawk kedua dalam armada global kami, selepas "
"[`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) di "
"AS (rantau `us-east`). `ibm_berlin` menampilkan Gate dua-qubit yang lebih "
"pantas berbanding `ibm_miami` (68 ns berbanding 138 ns, median) sambil "
"mengekalkan koherensi armada terkemuka yang serupa (T$_1$ ~350 &#181;s).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Since its release, Nighthawk has enabled research in regimes where "
"classical simulation becomes increasingly challenging. Specifically, its "
"architecture supports hardware-efficient workflows that map naturally onto "
"grid-based (lattice) models. See recent papers from "
"[Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) and "
"[Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), and their collaborators, "
"demonstrating simulation at scale on Nighthawk.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sejak keterbilannya, Nighthawk telah membolehkan penyelidikan dalam rejim "
"di mana simulasi klasik semakin mencabar. Khususnya, senibinanya menyokong "
"alur kerja cekap perkakasan yang memetakan secara semula jadi kepada model "
"berasaskan grid (kekisi). Lihat makalah terbaru daripada "
"[Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) dan "
"[Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), dan kolaborator mereka, "
"yang menunjukkan simulasi pada skala di Nighthawk.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Please note that `ibm_berlin` is currently an exploratory QPU that is "
"still being tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of "
"learning. As such, it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sila ambil perhatian bahawa `ibm_berlin` pada masa ini ialah QPU "
"penerokaan yang masih diuji dan dioptimumkan sebagai sebahagian daripada "
"kitaran pembelajaran berterusan kami. Oleh itu, ia buat sementara waktu "
"mempunyai batasan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to "
"4 ms, which impacts QPU time required to execute workloads. Users can "
"manually select a shorter repetition time, but performance might be "
"degraded.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masa ulangan lalai telah ditingkatkan sementara daripada 250 &#181;s kepada "
"4 ms, yang mempengaruhi masa QPU yang diperlukan untuk melaksanakan beban "
"kerja. Pengguna boleh memilih masa ulangan yang lebih pendek secara manual, "
"tetapi prestasi mungkin terjejas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit "
"measurements is limited.\n"
msgstr ""
"Litar dinamik belum disokong lagi, dan kualiti pengukuran pertengahan "
"Circuit adalah terhad.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Upcoming retirements\n"
msgstr "  #### Persaraan yang akan datang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  As we expand EU capacity and roll out the latest Nighthawk and Heron "
"processors, `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` are scheduled to be retired "
"on or around 30 April 2026.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Apabila kami mengembangkan kapasiti EU dan melancarkan pemproses Nighthawk"
" dan Heron terbaru, `ibm_brussels` dan `ibm_strasbourg` dijadualkan untuk "
"bersara pada atau sekitar 30 April 2026.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Once these QPUs are retired, they will no longer accept jobs. If your "
"workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please migrate to "
"another active QPU ahead of the retirement date to take advantage of the "
"latest systems. For guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the"
" following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-"
"retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sebaik sahaja QPU ini bersara, mereka tidak lagi akan menerima kerja. Jika"
" alur kerja anda menyasarkan `ibm_brussels` atau `ibm_strasbourg`, sila "
"berhijrah ke QPU aktif lain sebelum tarikh persaraan untuk memanfaatkan "
"sistem terbaru. Untuk panduan mendapatkan semula data daripada kerja "
"terdahulu, rujuk [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-"
"retired-qpu) berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### `ibm_torino` is now retired\n"
msgstr "  #### `ibm_torino` kini telah bersara\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The quantum computer `ibm_torino` has been retired and will no longer "
"accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on this "
"QPU might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Komputer kuantum `ibm_torino` telah bersara dan tidak lagi akan menerima "
"penyerahan beban kerja. Sebarang beban kerja yang telah berada dalam giliran"
" pada QPU ini mungkin masih diproses dan mengembalikan keputusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on "
"this QPU, refer to [these instructions.](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-"
"job-from-a-retired-qpu)\n"
msgstr ""
"  Jika anda ingin mendapatkan semula data kerja daripada beban kerja penting"
" yang dijalankan pada QPU ini, rujuk [arahan berikut.](/guides/retired-"
"qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### ibm_brussels and ibm_strasbourg are now retired\n"
msgstr "  #### ibm_brussels dan ibm_strasbourg kini telah bersara\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` have been retired and will no longer "
"accept jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"  `ibm_brussels` dan `ibm_strasbourg` telah bersara dan tidak lagi akan "
"menerima kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  This change is part of the continued evolution and expansion of the IBM "
"Quantum fleet in the EU, including the recently released Nighthawk QPU "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) "
"and the upgraded Heron r3 QPU "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen). "
"The global fleet has now fully transitioned away from Eagle, IBM Quantum's "
"first utility‑scale processor family, introduced in 2021.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Perubahan ini merupakan sebahagian daripada evolusi dan pengembangan "
"berterusan armada IBM Quantum di EU, termasuk QPU Nighthawk yang baru "
"dikeluarkan "
"[`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) "
"dan QPU Heron r3 yang ditingkatkan "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen). "
"Armada global kini telah sepenuhnya beralih daripada Eagle, keluarga "
"pemproses skala utiliti pertama IBM Quantum, yang diperkenalkan pada 2021.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If your workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please "
"migrate to another active QPU to take advantage of the latest hardware. For "
"guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the "
"[documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Jika alur kerja anda menyasarkan `ibm_brussels` atau `ibm_strasbourg`, "
"sila berhijrah ke QPU aktif lain untuk memanfaatkan perkakasan terbaru. "
"Untuk panduan mendapatkan semula data daripada kerja terdahulu, rujuk "
"[dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  ### March 2026\n"
msgstr "  ### Mac 2026\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### The EU gets its first Heron r3\n"
msgstr "  #### EU mendapat Heron r3 pertama\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Maintenance has been completed on "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) "
"and the QPU is now back online in the eu‑de region.  `ibm_aachen` has also "
"been upgraded to be the first QPU in the EU to feature the latest [Heron "
"r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-up-on-an-"
"earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k) processor. It is the "
"third r3 in our global fleet, after "
"[`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) "
"and "
"[`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh)"
" in the US.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Penyelenggaraan telah selesai dilakukan pada "
"[`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) "
"dan QPU kini kembali dalam talian di rantau eu‑de. `ibm_aachen` juga telah "
"ditingkatkan untuk menjadi QPU pertama di EU yang menampilkan pemproses "
"[Heron r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-"
"up-on-an-earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k) terbaru. Ia "
"merupakan r3 ketiga dalam armada global kami, selepas "
"[`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) "
"dan "
"[`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh)"
" di AS.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Heron r3 continues to deliver improved error rates and overall system "
"performance compared to Heron r2, demonstrating more reliable execution and "
"better results for workloads. For example, on `ibm_aachen`, we observe a "
"large boost in $T_2$ (phase coherence time) from 150&nbsp;&#181;s to "
"250&nbsp;&#181;s. You can view metrics like these for all QPUs in the shared"
" fleet on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Heron r3 terus memberikan kadar ralat yang lebih baik dan prestasi sistem "
"keseluruhan berbanding Heron r2, menunjukkan pelaksanaan yang lebih boleh "
"dipercayai dan keputusan yang lebih baik untuk beban kerja. Sebagai contoh, "
"pada `ibm_aachen`, kami memerhatikan peningkatan besar dalam $T_2$ (masa "
"koherensi fasa) daripada 150&nbsp;&#181;s kepada 250&nbsp;&#181;s. Anda "
"boleh melihat metrik seperti ini untuk semua QPU dalam armada kongsi di "
"halaman [Sumber Komput](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  ### February 2026\n"
msgstr "  ### Februari 2026\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### `ibm_torino` to retire\n"
msgstr "  #### `ibm_torino` akan bersara\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The `ibm_torino` QPU will retire on or around 1 April 2026. Once this QPU "
"is retired, it will no longer accept jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"  QPU `ibm_torino` akan bersara pada atau sekitar 1 April 2026. Sebaik "
"sahaja QPU ini bersara, ia tidak lagi akan menerima kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If you would like to retrieve job data from important past jobs, please "
"refer to the following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-"
"from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Jika anda ingin mendapatkan semula data kerja daripada kerja terdahulu "
"yang penting, sila rujuk [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-"
"from-a-retired-qpu) berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  #### Increase in repetition delay time maximum\n"
msgstr "  #### Peningkatan maksimum masa kelewatan ulangan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  To provide more flexibility for users, we have expanded the allowable "
"repetition delay time range from 20-500 &#181;s to 20-2000 &#181;s on our "
"Heron and Eagle QPUs. The Nighthawk QPU delay time range continues to be "
"1000-4000 &#181;s as previously announced. Note that if you choose to "
"increase repetition delay (`rep_delay`), it will have a direct impact on "
"your execution time and capacity consumption, but it might improve the "
"fidelity of certain circuits. The default `rep_delay` remains unchanged on "
"all QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Untuk memberikan lebih fleksibiliti kepada pengguna, kami telah "
"mengembangkan julat masa kelewatan ulangan yang dibenarkan daripada 20-500 "
"&#181;s kepada 20-2000 &#181;s pada QPU Heron dan Eagle kami. Julat masa "
"kelewatan QPU Nighthawk terus menjadi 1000-4000 &#181;s seperti yang telah "
"diumumkan sebelum ini. Ambil perhatian bahawa jika anda memilih untuk "
"meningkatkan kelewatan ulangan (`rep_delay`), ia akan memberi kesan langsung"
" kepada masa pelaksanaan dan penggunaan kapasiti anda, tetapi mungkin "
"meningkatkan ketepatan Circuit tertentu. `rep_delay` lalai kekal tidak "
"berubah pada semua QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  You can find more information about repetition delay time, including how "
"to change it, in [Qubit initialization](/guides/repetition-rate-"
"execution).\n"
msgstr ""
"  Anda boleh mendapatkan maklumat lanjut tentang masa kelewatan ulangan, "
"termasuk cara mengubahnya, dalam [Permulaan semula "
"Qubit](/guides/repetition-rate-execution).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ### January 2026\n"
"  - The latest enhancements to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"  ### Januari 2026\n"
"  - Penambahbaikan terkini pada halaman [Sumber Komput](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) merangkumi perkara berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single"
" table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet "
"across the two regions. (You can still filter the Compute resources table by"
" region using the funnel icon.)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pandangan QPU bersatu** - Semua QPU merentasi rantau kini dipaparkan dalam"
" satu jadual, memudahkan untuk melihat status dan kalibrasi armada kongsi "
"merentasi dua rantau. (Anda masih boleh menapis jadual Sumber Komput "
"mengikut rantau menggunakan ikon corong.)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Single maintenance schedule** - The maintenance schedule is now at the top"
" of the page, even when no events are currently planned.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jadual penyelenggaraan tunggal** - Jadual penyelenggaraan kini berada di "
"bahagian atas halaman, walaupun ketika tiada acara yang dirancang pada masa "
"ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**\"Instance access\" details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a new "
"Instance access section shows all instances that grant the user access to "
"that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Butiran \"Akses instans\"** - Apabila melihat butiran QPU, bahagian Akses "
"instans baharu menunjukkan semua instans yang memberikan akses pengguna "
"kepada QPU tersebut untuk akaun yang dipilih.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The first Nighthawk QPU and latest Heron QPU are now available.** These "
"two powerful new processors debuted at the [IBM Quantum Developer "
"Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) in November.\n"
msgstr ""
"**QPU Nighthawk pertama dan QPU Heron terbaru kini tersedia.** Dua pemproses"
" baharu yang berkuasa ini telah diperkenalkan di [IBM Quantum Developer "
"Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) pada bulan "
"November.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to `ibm_miami`, the first IBM "
"Quantum Nighthawk QPU. Our most advanced quantum processor to date, "
"Nighthawk is a 120-qubit device with a square-lattice topology (218 couplers"
" versus Heron's 176) that is designed to support more complex workloads. "
"Nighthawk has the highest coherence of our fleet - even higher than what was"
" reported at QDC - with a median T1 of 350 &#181;s.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelan Premium dan Flex kini mempunyai akses awal kepada `ibm_miami`, QPU IBM"
" Quantum Nighthawk pertama. Pemproses kuantum paling canggih kami setakat "
"ini, Nighthawk ialah peranti 120-qubit dengan topologi kekisi segi empat "
"(218 pengganding berbanding 176 milik Heron) yang direka untuk menyokong "
"beban kerja yang lebih kompleks. Nighthawk mempunyai koherensi tertinggi "
"dalam armada kami - bahkan lebih tinggi daripada yang dilaporkan di QDC - "
"dengan median T1 sebanyak 350 &#181;s.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that `ibm_miami` is currently an exploratory QPU that is still being "
"tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of learning. As such, "
"it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ambil perhatian bahawa `ibm_miami` pada masa ini ialah QPU penerokaan yang "
"masih diuji dan dioptimumkan sebagai sebahagian daripada kitaran "
"pembelajaran berterusan kami. Oleh itu, ia buat sementara waktu mempunyai "
"batasan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to 4"
" ms, which will impact QPU time required to execute workloads\n"
msgstr ""
"Masa ulangan lalai telah ditingkatkan sementara daripada 250 &#181;s kepada "
"4 ms, yang akan mempengaruhi masa QPU yang diperlukan untuk melaksanakan "
"beban kerja\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit "
"measurements is limited\n"
msgstr ""
"Litar dinamik belum disokong lagi, dan kualiti pengukuran pertengahan "
"Circuit adalah terhad\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, Premium, Flex, and Pay-As-You-Go Plans now have access to "
"`ibm_boston`, our most performant IBM Quantum Heron r3 to date. It has "
"demonstrated an EPLG at 100 qubits of 2.15e-3, with 57 of 176 possible two-"
"qubit gates below the 1e-3 error level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, Pelan Premium, Flex, dan Pay-As-You-Go kini mempunyai akses "
"kepada `ibm_boston`, IBM Quantum Heron r3 kami yang paling berprestasi "
"setakat ini. Ia telah menunjukkan EPLG pada 100 qubit sebanyak 2.15e-3, "
"dengan 57 daripada 176 Gate dua-qubit yang mungkin di bawah tahap ralat "
"1e-3.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Introducing instance archiving for administrators on IBM Quantum "
"Platform.** With this update, administrators can archive any instance within"
" their account. Archiving an instance ensures that:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Memperkenalkan pengarkiban instans untuk pentadbir di IBM Quantum "
"Platform.** Dengan kemas kini ini, pentadbir boleh mengarkibkan mana-mana "
"instans dalam akaun mereka. Mengarkibkan instans memastikan bahawa:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Collaborators retain access to results and QPU metrics, properties, and "
"calibrations from past workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kolaborator mengekalkan akses kepada keputusan dan metrik QPU, sifat, dan "
"kalibrasi daripada beban kerja terdahulu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"No new workloads can be submitted to the archived instance, preventing "
"unintended usage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiada beban kerja baharu boleh dihantar kepada instans yang diarkibkan, "
"mencegah penggunaan yang tidak disengajakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Archived instances do not subtract anything from your account's plan "
"allocation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Instans yang diarkibkan tidak mengurangkan apa pun daripada peruntukan pelan"
" akaun anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All archived instances are neatly organized under a dedicated \"Archived\" "
"tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua instans yang diarkibkan disusun dengan kemas di bawah tab "
"\"Diarkibkan\" yang khusus.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      - Administrators can reactivate an instance at any time.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Previous updates (2025)**\">\n"
msgstr ""
"      - Pentadbir boleh mengaktifkan semula instans pada bila-bila masa.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Kemas kini sebelumnya (2025)**\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What's new at IBM Quantum - 4Q 2025 {#whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-4q-2025}"
msgstr ""
"Apa yang baharu di IBM Quantum - S4 2025 {#whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-4q-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 "
"2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) quarterly update "
"is now live!\n"
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini suku tahunan [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 "
"2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) kini tersedia!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This convenient wrap-up aims to get you started exploring the latest "
"hardware, software, research, and community events from IBM Quantum and our "
"partner ecosystem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ringkasan yang mudah ini bertujuan untuk membantu anda mula meneroka "
"perkakasan, perisian, penyelidikan, dan acara komuniti terbaru daripada IBM "
"Quantum dan ekosistem rakan kongsi kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Highlights include the recently deployed IBM Quantum Nighthawk and IBM "
"Quantum Heron r3 QPUs, a call for submissions to the new open-source Quantum"
" Advantage Tracker, and Qiskit C++, a new project designed to help HPC "
"developers build production-grade quantum-centric supercomputing "
"workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sorotan termasuk QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk dan IBM Quantum Heron r3 yang "
"baru digunakan, seruan untuk penyerahan kepada Penjejak Kelebihan Kuantum "
"sumber terbuka baharu, dan Qiskit C++, projek baharu yang direka untuk "
"membantu pembangun HPC membina alur kerja pengkomputeran super berpusat "
"kuantum gred pengeluaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This quarterly update also spotlights notable benchmarks, including:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini suku tahunan ini juga menyerlahkan penanda aras ketara, "
"termasuk:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Best EPLG: 0.23% on `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"
msgstr "EPLG terbaik: 0.23% pada `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Best CLOPS: 330K+ across 7 QPUs\n"
msgstr "CLOPS terbaik: 330K+ merentasi 7 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Total available qubits: 2,477 across 17 QPUs\n"
msgstr "Jumlah qubit yang tersedia: 2,477 merentasi 17 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Total papers using IBM Quantum or Qiskit: 5,635\n"
msgstr "Jumlah makalah menggunakan IBM Quantum atau Qiskit: 5,635\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Discover these updates and more.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-"
"new-q4-2025)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Temui kemas kini ini dan banyak "
"lagi.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute resources page update – Unified QPU view across regions {#compute-"
"resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini halaman Sumber Komput – Pandangan QPU bersatu merentasi rantau "
"{#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We’ve enhanced the [Compute "
"resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page! New features "
"include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami telah mempertingkatkan halaman [Sumber "
"Komput](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers)! Ciri baharu termasuk yang "
"berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single"
" table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet "
"across the two regions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pandangan QPU bersatu** - Semua QPU merentasi rantau kini dipaparkan dalam"
" satu jadual, memudahkan untuk melihat status dan kalibrasi armada kongsi "
"merentasi dua rantau.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Clearer \"Instance Access\" Details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a "
"new Instance access section shows all instances that grant you access to "
"that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Butiran \"Akses Instans\" yang lebih jelas** - Apabila melihat butiran "
"QPU, bahagian Akses instans baharu menunjukkan semua instans yang memberikan"
" anda akses kepada QPU tersebut untuk akaun yang dipilih.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can still filter the Compute resources table by region using the funnel "
"icon at the top of the table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda masih boleh menapis jadual Sumber Komput mengikut rantau menggunakan "
"ikon corong di bahagian atas jadual.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"
msgstr "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The quantum computer `ibm_brisbane` has been retired and will no longer "
"accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these"
" QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komputer kuantum `ibm_brisbane` telah bersara dan tidak lagi akan menerima "
"penyerahan beban kerja. Sebarang beban kerja yang telah berada dalam giliran"
" pada QPU ini mungkin masih diproses dan mengembalikan keputusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on this "
"QPU, refer to [these instructions.](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-"
"from-a-retired-qpu)\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda ingin mendapatkan semula data kerja daripada beban kerja penting "
"yang dijalankan pada QPU ini, rujuk [arahan berikut.](/guides/retired-"
"qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025}"
msgstr "Oktober 2025 {#october-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The IBM Quantum fleet welcomes `ibm_fez` and `ibm_marrakesh` to the Open "
"Plan! All users can access these computers as of 27 October.\n"
msgstr ""
"Armada IBM Quantum mengalu-alukan `ibm_fez` dan `ibm_marrakesh` ke Pelan "
"Terbuka! Semua pengguna boleh mengakses komputer ini mulai 27 Oktober.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A reminder that `ibm_brisbane` will retire on 3 Nov 2025, so plan your "
"experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Peringatan bahawa `ibm_brisbane` akan bersara pada 3 Nov 2025, jadi rancang "
"eksperimen anda dengan sewajarnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Learn quantum computing in your own language**: We're excited to announce "
"that translations are now available across all documentation and learning "
"pages on IBM Quantum Platform! Translations have been the most-requested "
"feature in user feedback, and now, quantum learning and development are more"
" accessible than ever.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pelajari pengkomputeran kuantum dalam bahasa anda sendiri**: Kami dengan "
"gembira mengumumkan bahawa terjemahan kini tersedia merentasi semua halaman "
"dokumentasi dan pembelajaran di IBM Quantum Platform! Terjemahan telah "
"menjadi ciri yang paling banyak diminta dalam maklum balas pengguna, dan "
"kini, pembelajaran dan pembangunan kuantum lebih mudah diakses berbanding "
"sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Translations of **tutorials, courses, documentation, and announcements** are"
" now available in seven languages: French, German, Italian, Japanese, "
"Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terjemahan **tutorial, kursus, dokumentasi, dan pengumuman** kini tersedia "
"dalam tujuh bahasa: Perancis, Jerman, Itali, Jepun, Korea, Portugis, dan "
"Sepanyol.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Multilingual search**: Use the search bar to find what you need in your "
"preferred language.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Carian berbilang bahasa**: Gunakan bar carian untuk mencari apa yang anda "
"perlukan dalam bahasa pilihan anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Downloadable resources**: Download resources such as guides or tutorials "
"in the language that suits you best.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sumber boleh muat turun**: Muat turun sumber seperti panduan atau tutorial"
" dalam bahasa yang sesuai untuk anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Localized API references**: Explore the latest version of the API "
"reference and REST APIs with fully translated documentation (current "
"versions only).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Rujukan API yang disetempat**: Terokai versi terkini rujukan API dan REST "
"API dengan dokumentasi yang diterjemahkan sepenuhnya (versi semasa "
"sahaja).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Error messages & solutions**: Understand issues faster with translated "
"error codes and suggested solutions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mesej ralat & penyelesaian**: Fahami isu dengan lebih cepat dengan kod "
"ralat yang diterjemahkan dan penyelesaian yang dicadangkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Find a translation error? Let us know! [Submit a translation "
"issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml)"
" in our GitHub repo.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Terjumpai ralat terjemahan? Maklumkan kepada kami! [Hantar isu "
"terjemahan](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml)"
" dalam repositori GitHub kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  *Note that there is a processing delay between the publication of new "
"content and its translation, so you might only see the English version of "
"recently released content for a few days while the translation is "
"underway.*\n"
msgstr ""
"  *Ambil perhatian bahawa terdapat kelewatan pemprosesan antara penerbitan "
"kandungan baharu dan terjemahannya, jadi anda mungkin hanya melihat versi "
"Inggeris kandungan yang baru diterbitkan selama beberapa hari semasa "
"terjemahan sedang dijalankan.*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Learning in IBM Quantum Platform** now has an updated home page to help "
"you navigate the educational resources available, as well as two new catalog"
" pages to help browse courses and modules. [Check out the "
"updates!](/learning)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pembelajaran dalam IBM Quantum Platform** kini mempunyai halaman utama "
"yang dikemas kini untuk membantu anda menavigasi sumber pendidikan yang "
"tersedia, serta dua halaman katalog baharu untuk membantu melayari kursus "
"dan modul. [Lihat kemas kini!](/learning)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"
msgstr "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software "
"survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) helps capture the needs and "
"concerns of anyone who works with quantum software - including you! The "
"survey results provide valuable feedback for our team of Qiskit developers, "
"and helps us to understand the broader quantum software landscape.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Tinjauan Perisian Sumber Terbuka Kuantum Unitary "
"Foundation](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) membantu menangkap "
"keperluan dan kebimbangan sesiapa yang bekerja dengan perisian kuantum - "
"termasuk anda! Hasil tinjauan memberikan maklum balas berharga untuk pasukan"
" pembangun Qiskit kami, dan membantu kami memahami landskap perisian kuantum"
" yang lebih luas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have a few minutes, please share the link or consider filling it out "
"today! The survey is open through 3 October 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda ada beberapa minit, sila kongsi pautan atau pertimbangkan untuk "
"mengisinya hari ini! Tinjauan ini dibuka sehingga 3 Oktober 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"
msgstr ""
"[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"
msgstr "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We plan to retire `ibm_brisbane` on or around 1 November 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami merancang untuk menyarakan `ibm_brisbane` pada atau sekitar 1 November "
"2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once this QPU is retired, it will no longer accept jobs. If any jobs are "
"queued on the QPU at the time of its retirement, they will still run and "
"return results. Please plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebaik sahaja QPU ini bersara, ia tidak lagi akan menerima kerja. Jika ada "
"kerja yang berada dalam giliran pada QPU pada masa persaraannya, ia masih "
"akan dijalankan dan mengembalikan keputusan. Sila rancang eksperimen anda "
"dengan sewajarnya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "31 July 2025 {#31-july-2025}"
msgstr "31 Julai 2025 {#31-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Today, we are thrilled to announce the launch of ibm_pittsburgh, our first "
"quantum computer powered by the new Heron Revision 3 (r3) QPU, and located "
"in our Poughkeepsie quantum datacenter. r3 is the result of targeted "
"improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout "
"performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hari ini, kami dengan gembira mengumumkan pelancaran ibm_pittsburgh, "
"komputer kuantum pertama kami yang dikuasakan oleh QPU Heron Semakan 3 (r3) "
"baharu, dan terletak di pusat data kuantum Poughkeepsie kami. r3 adalah "
"hasil penambahbaikan yang disasarkan yang memberi kesan langsung kepada "
"koherensi, ketepatan Gate, dan prestasi readout.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The results speak for themselves, including an industry-leading ~350 us of "
"T2 coherence; see the [latest metrics on "
"Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) "
"on IBM Quantum Platform. This steady, measured progress is at the center of "
"our strategy for delivering reliable and performant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hasilnya bercakap sendiri, termasuk ~350 us T2 koherensi terkemuka industri;"
" lihat [metrik terbaru pada "
"Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) "
"di IBM Quantum Platform. Kemajuan yang mantap dan terukur ini berada di "
"tengah-tengah strategi kami untuk menghantar pengkomputeran kuantum yang "
"boleh dipercayai dan berprestasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As recently announced, today we retire one of our Eagle processors, "
"ibm_sherbrooke. We invite you to migrate to our quantum computers powered by"
" Heron processors, to take advantage of the lower error rates (approximately"
" 5x lower EPLG) and faster gates (nearly 8x faster), leading to more "
"performant circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang telah diumumkan baru-baru ini, hari ini kami menyarakan salah "
"satu pemproses Eagle kami, ibm_sherbrooke. Kami menjemput anda untuk "
"berhijrah ke komputer kuantum kami yang dikuasakan oleh pemproses Heron, "
"untuk memanfaatkan kadar ralat yang lebih rendah (kira-kira 5x EPLG yang "
"lebih rendah) dan Gate yang lebih pantas (hampir 8x lebih pantas), "
"menghasilkan Circuit yang lebih berprestasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Together, let’s open the door to more complex algorithmic exploration and "
"real-world applications.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bersama-sama, marilah kita buka pintu kepada penerokaan algoritma yang lebih"
" kompleks dan aplikasi dunia nyata.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 July 2025 {#24-july-2025}"
msgstr "24 Julai 2025 {#24-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum technology is advancing rapidly, and it can be challenging to keep "
"up. To help you stay in the loop, we’ve put together a roundup featuring the"
" newest tools, performance improvements, and updates from IBM Quantum. It "
"includes links to code examples, documentation, and research to help you get"
" the most out of our latest developments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Teknologi kuantum berkembang pesat, dan ia boleh mencabar untuk "
"mengikutinya. Untuk membantu anda kekal terkini, kami telah menyusun "
"ringkasan yang menampilkan alatan terbaru, penambahbaikan prestasi, dan "
"kemas kini daripada IBM Quantum. Ia merangkumi pautan ke contoh kod, "
"dokumentasi, dan penyelidikan untuk membantu anda mendapatkan manfaat "
"terbaik daripada perkembangan terbaru kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Learn what's new at IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-"
"quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Ketahui apa yang baharu di IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-"
"quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "27 June 2025 {#27-june-2025}"
msgstr "27 Jun 2025 {#27-june-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_sherbrooke` will now retire on or around 28 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "`ibm_sherbrooke` kini akan bersara pada atau sekitar 28 Julai 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before it is "
"retired.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan anda mendapatkan semula data kerja daripada kerja terdahulu yang "
"penting sebelum ia bersara.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 June 2025 {#24-june-2025}"
msgstr "24 Jun 2025 {#24-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Profile page: Now you can find integrated profile details directly in the "
"new platform. Find your profile by clicking on the user icon in the top "
"right or visiting your [profile "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile).\n"
msgstr ""
"Halaman profil: Kini anda boleh mencari butiran profil bersepadu terus dalam"
" platform baharu. Cari profil anda dengan mengklik ikon pengguna di bahagian"
" kanan atas atau melawati [halaman "
"profil](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile) anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Public backends: View a list of US backends without logging in, available on"
" the updated [Compute Resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Backend awam: Lihat senarai Backend AS tanpa log masuk, tersedia di halaman "
"[Sumber Komput](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) yang dikemas "
"kini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learning: Quantum computing courses have now been released in the upgraded "
"platform, along with new educational modules designed to help teachers bring"
" Qiskit into their classrooms. This is the first step towards migrating IBM "
"Quantum Learning to the new platform, with more resources to be released in "
"the coming weeks. Resources can be accessed without needing to log in at "
"[IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Check out new and updated content, "
"including [Quantum diagonalization algorithms](/learning/courses/quantum-"
"diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum computing in "
"practice](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), and Qiskit in "
"Classrooms modules like [Quantum mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-"
"mechanics) and [Computer science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pembelajaran: Kursus pengkomputeran kuantum kini telah dikeluarkan dalam "
"platform yang ditingkatkan, bersama dengan modul pendidikan baharu yang "
"direka untuk membantu guru membawa Qiskit ke dalam bilik darjah mereka. Ini "
"ialah langkah pertama ke arah memindahkan IBM Quantum Learning ke platform "
"baharu, dengan lebih banyak sumber akan dikeluarkan dalam minggu-minggu akan"
" datang. Sumber boleh diakses tanpa perlu log masuk di [IBM Quantum "
"Learning](/learning). Lihat kandungan baharu dan yang dikemas kini, termasuk"
" [Algoritma penjajaran kuantum](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-"
"algorithms), [Pengkomputeran kuantum dalam "
"amalan](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), dan modul Qiskit "
"dalam Bilik Darjah seperti [Mekanik kuantum](/learning/modules/quantum-"
"mechanics) dan [Sains komputer](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Composer: The circuit-building "
"[Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) has now been migrated to "
"the new platform. The experience is largely the same, except for files will "
"no longer be stored in the platform, and will need to be downloaded locally."
" Find more details in the [Composer documentation](/guides/composer).\n"
msgstr ""
"Komposer IBM Quantum: [Komposer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) "
"pembinaan Circuit kini telah dipindahkan ke platform baharu. Pengalamannya "
"sebahagian besarnya sama, kecuali fail tidak lagi akan disimpan dalam "
"platform, dan perlu dimuat turun secara tempatan. Cari butiran lanjut dalam "
"[dokumentasi Komposer](/guides/composer).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Announcements: Now you can access news, software updates, and service alerts"
" on the new platform. Click the bell icon in the top navigation bar or the "
"link under Featured resources on the [home "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) to visit the new Announcements page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengumuman: Kini anda boleh mengakses berita, kemas kini perisian, dan "
"amaran perkhidmatan di platform baharu. Klik ikon loceng dalam bar navigasi "
"atas atau pautan di bawah Sumber pilihan di [halaman "
"utama](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) untuk melawati halaman Pengumuman "
"baharu.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025}"
msgstr "5 Jun 2025 {#5-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Added instance job filter: The platform now displays only your workloads by "
"default. On the dashboard, you will see only the latest workloads you have "
"submitted to instances within your account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menambah penapis kerja instans: Platform kini memaparkan hanya beban kerja "
"anda secara lalai. Di papan pemuka, anda hanya akan melihat beban kerja "
"terkini yang telah anda hantar kepada instans dalam akaun anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Only the latest workloads now shown by "
"default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Hanya beban kerja terkini yang kini ditunjukkan secara "
"lalai](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A new qiskit-ibm-runtime release, featuring:\n"
msgstr "Keluaran qiskit-ibm-runtime baharu, menampilkan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support for private jobs for developers of Qiskit Functions\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk kerja peribadi bagi pembangun Fungsi Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new channel for the platform that makes instance selection optional, which"
" simplifies account setup and backend access by automatically checking all "
"available instances. This update benefits users who manage multiple "
"instances or prefer a streamlined workflow without specifying instance "
"details each time. Developers and researchers working across various "
"projects with different levels of access and multiple backends will find "
"this especially helpful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saluran baharu untuk platform yang menjadikan pemilihan instans sebagai "
"pilihan, yang memudahkan persediaan akaun dan akses Backend dengan menyemak "
"semua instans yang tersedia secara automatik. Kemas kini ini memberi manfaat"
" kepada pengguna yang menguruskan berbilang instans atau lebih suka alur "
"kerja yang lebih lancar tanpa perlu menentukan butiran instans setiap kali. "
"Pembangun dan penyelidik yang bekerja merentasi pelbagai projek dengan tahap"
" akses yang berbeza dan berbilang Backend akan mendapati ini sangat "
"berguna.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 May 2025 {#15-may-2025}"
msgstr "15 Mei 2025 {#15-may-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Note: This is relevant to IBM Quantum Platform Classic (at "
"https://quantum.ibm.com/) only.*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Nota: Ini berkaitan dengan IBM Quantum Platform Classic (di "
"https://quantum.ibm.com/) sahaja.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are still using [IBM Quantum Platform "
"Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) at https://quantum.ibm.com, please note "
"that it will no longer be accessible starting 1 July 2025. At that time, "
"Open Plan access will only be available on the [new "
"Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and you will no longer have "
"access to this platform or its data. Download your data and migrate to the "
"new platform as soon as possible to avoid interruptions in your work. See "
"the migration guide for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda masih menggunakan [IBM Quantum Platform "
"Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) di https://quantum.ibm.com, sila ambil "
"perhatian bahawa ia tidak lagi boleh diakses mulai 1 Julai 2025. Pada masa "
"itu, akses Pelan Terbuka hanya akan tersedia di [platform "
"baharu](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), dan anda tidak lagi akan mempunyai "
"akses kepada platform ini atau datanya. Muat turun data anda dan berhijrah "
"ke platform baharu secepat mungkin untuk mengelakkan gangguan dalam kerja "
"anda. Lihat panduan migrasi untuk butiran lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users of other plans (for example, Premium Plan or On-Prem Plan) should wait"
" for specific instructions from their administrators before migrating.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna pelan lain (contohnya, Pelan Premium atau Pelan On-Prem) hendaklah "
"menunggu arahan khusus daripada pentadbir mereka sebelum berhijrah.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "8 May 2025 {#8-may-2025}"
msgstr "8 Mei 2025 {#8-may-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), a new resource "
"consumption offering, has been released.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Pelan Flex](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), tawaran penggunaan"
" sumber baharu, telah dikeluarkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) are now available on the"
" platform to help users with use-case exploration.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) kini tersedia di platform"
" untuk membantu pengguna dengan penerokaan kes penggunaan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) has "
"launched on the platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Katalog Fungsi Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) telah "
"dilancarkan di platform.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Updated Session OpenAPI schema: `backend_name` field is now nullable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Skema OpenAPI Sesi yang dikemas kini: medan `backend_name` kini boleh "
"menjadi null.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"
msgstr "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instance limits: Individuals can view [available time and "
"usage](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), which displays alerts when "
"approaching limits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Had instans: Individu boleh melihat [masa dan penggunaan yang "
"tersedia](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), yang memaparkan amaran "
"apabila mendekati had.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Administrator permissions: Administrators can view overall usage, cycle "
"period, and remaining time per plan in the Instances page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Keizinan pentadbir: Pentadbir boleh melihat penggunaan keseluruhan, tempoh "
"kitaran, dan masa yang tinggal setiap pelan dalam halaman Instans.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Search: Search is now integrated and available for filtering documentation "
"content, including guides and API references.\n"
msgstr ""
"Carian: Carian kini disepadukan dan tersedia untuk menapis kandungan "
"dokumentasi, termasuk panduan dan rujukan API.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Billing: Pay-As-You-Go users can find a link to billing by clicking the "
"overflow menu for each instance on the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengebilan: Pengguna Pay-As-You-Go boleh mencari pautan ke pengebilan dengan"
" mengklik menu limpahan untuk setiap instans di halaman "
"[Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"New sign-in option: Sign-in with Google is now available on the [sign-in "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilihan log masuk baharu: Log masuk dengan Google kini tersedia di [halaman "
"log masuk](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Bug fixes:\n"
msgstr "Pembetulan pepijat:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed failed batch sessions for Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Menangani sesi kumpulan yang gagal untuk pengguna Pelan Terbuka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed batch sessions not closing properly.\n"
msgstr "Menangani sesi kumpulan yang tidak ditutup dengan betul.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Improved platform stability by improving error handling and better "
"recovery.\n"
msgstr ""
"Meningkatkan kestabilan platform dengan memperbaiki pengendalian ralat dan "
"pemulihan yang lebih baik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Addressed an issue that prevented QPU metrics to be displayed for the QPUs "
"in the eu-de region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menangani isu yang menghalang metrik QPU daripada dipaparkan untuk QPU di "
"rantau eu-de.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deprecation reminder: The deprecation date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic "
"has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Peringatan penamatan: Tarikh penamatan untuk IBM Quantum Platform Classic "
"telah ditetapkan pada 1 Julai 2025.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"
msgstr "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ibm_kyiv` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. "
"Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be "
"processed and return results.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ibm_kyiv` telah bersara dan tidak lagi akan menerima penyerahan beban "
"kerja. Sebarang beban kerja yang telah berada dalam giliran pada QPU ini "
"mungkin masih diproses dan mengembalikan keputusan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"
msgstr "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Updated navigation to remove duplicated pages:\n"
msgstr ""
"Navigasi yang dikemas kini untuk mengalih keluar halaman yang diduplikasi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Administration section has been renamed \"Access management\" and now "
"only focuses on managing users and access groups.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian Pentadbiran telah dinamakan semula \"Pengurusan akses\" dan kini "
"hanya memberi tumpuan kepada pengurusan pengguna dan kumpulan akses.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is only one page each for managing instances and workloads; there are "
"no longer separate pages for each in the Administration section.  Instead, "
"what you can view and manage on each page is dependent on your access and "
"permissions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hanya terdapat satu halaman masing-masing untuk menguruskan instans dan "
"beban kerja; tidak lagi terdapat halaman berasingan untuk setiap satu dalam "
"bahagian Pentadbiran. Sebaliknya, apa yang boleh anda lihat dan urus pada "
"setiap halaman bergantung pada akses dan keizinan anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The analytics page (visible only to those with certain access) has been "
"moved into the main navigation menu, to make it easier to find.\n"
msgstr ""
"Halaman analitik (hanya kelihatan kepada mereka yang mempunyai akses "
"tertentu) telah dipindahkan ke menu navigasi utama, untuk memudahkan "
"pencarian.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launched two new QPUs: ibm_aachen (eu-de region) and ibm_kingston (us-east "
"region)\n"
msgstr ""
"Melancarkan dua QPU baharu: ibm_aachen (rantau eu-de) dan ibm_kingston "
"(rantau us-east)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Individuals who can view the analytics page can now filter the data to view "
"information per plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"Individu yang boleh melihat halaman analitik kini boleh menapis data untuk "
"melihat maklumat mengikut pelan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Administrators can now more easily add multiple individuals to an access "
"group due to the addition of an existing account members table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pentadbir kini boleh menambah berbilang individu ke kumpulan akses dengan "
"lebih mudah disebabkan penambahan jadual ahli akaun sedia ada.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Premium plan instance administrators can set the instance allocation as a "
"usage limit, so that usage in those instances cannot exceed the time "
"alloted. See the [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits)"
" guide for instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pentadbir instans pelan Premium boleh menetapkan peruntukan instans sebagai "
"had penggunaan, supaya penggunaan dalam instans tersebut tidak boleh "
"melebihi masa yang diperuntukkan. Lihat panduan [Tetapkan had peruntukan "
"instans](/guides/allocation-limits) untuk arahan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the sunset date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for "
"1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahawa tarikh matahari terbenam untuk IBM Quantum Platform "
"Classic telah ditetapkan pada 1 Julai 2025.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"
msgstr "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two new 156Q Heron R2 QPUs, "
"[ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), located "
"in the EU region, and "
"[ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), "
"located in the US region, are now available.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dua QPU Heron R2 156Q baharu, "
"[ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), terletak "
"di rantau EU, dan "
"[ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), "
"terletak di rantau AS, kini tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View the systems you have access to with your selected instance in the "
"[Compute resources](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) page on IBM "
"Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat sistem yang anda ada akses dengan instans yang dipilih di halaman "
"[Sumber komput](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) di IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "27 March 2025 {#27-march-2025}"
msgstr "27 Mac 2025 {#27-march-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Cost limits for Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Pay-As-You-Go Plan users with "
"sufficient access can now view and edit [maximum cost "
"limits](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) for their instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Had kos untuk Pelan Pay-As-You-Go** - Pengguna Pelan Pay-As-You-Go dengan "
"akses yang mencukupi kini boleh melihat dan mengedit [had kos "
"maksimum](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) untuk instans mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Job management updates** - Now only administrators can delete workloads "
"created by other users in an account, and collaborators will only be able to"
" delete their own workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kemas kini pengurusan kerja** - Kini hanya pentadbir boleh memadamkan "
"beban kerja yang dibuat oleh pengguna lain dalam akaun, dan kolaborator "
"hanya akan dapat memadamkan beban kerja mereka sendiri.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Updated authentication error messages** - Error messaging has been "
"improved for account and authentication processes to reduce issues with "
"signup flow. The [Support page](/guides/support) has been expanded with "
"recommendations for troubleshooting and resolving common errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mesej ralat pengesahan yang dikemas kini** - Mesej ralat telah "
"dipertingkatkan untuk proses akaun dan pengesahan bagi mengurangkan isu "
"dengan aliran pendaftaran. [Halaman Sokongan](/guides/support) telah "
"diperluaskan dengan cadangan untuk menyelesaikan masalah dan menyelesaikan "
"ralat biasa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Increased default data retention** - The default data retention period for"
" the new IBM Quantum Platform has been increased to three years, up from one"
" year on IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Penahanan data lalai yang ditingkatkan** - Tempoh penahanan data lalai "
"untuk IBM Quantum Platform baharu telah ditingkatkan kepada tiga tahun, naik"
" daripada satu tahun di IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resolved inconsistent behavior due to caching** - Some inconsistent "
"behavior seen when updating instance limits, tags, and QPU resources has "
"been resolved, which was due to caching.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Menyelesaikan tingkah laku tidak konsisten akibat caching** - Sesetengah "
"tingkah laku tidak konsisten yang dilihat semasa mengemas kini had instans, "
"tag, dan sumber QPU telah diselesaikan, yang disebabkan oleh caching.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For full details on the early access release and upcoming improvements, "
"[check out the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk butiran penuh tentang keluaran akses awal dan penambahbaikan yang akan"
" datang, [lihat blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "25 March 2025 {#25-march-2025}"
msgstr "25 Mac 2025 {#25-march-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An IBM Quantum Network exclusive: Join us for our first quarterly IBM "
"Quantum Product Updates Webinar, a series in which we unveil the latest "
"advancements in our products and offerings, showcase partner use cases, and "
"provide the opportunity for Q&A with quantum experts.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eksklusif untuk Rangkaian IBM Quantum: Sertai kami untuk Webinar Kemas Kini "
"Produk IBM Quantum suku tahunan pertama kami, satu siri di mana kami "
"mendedahkan kemajuan terkini dalam produk dan tawaran kami, mempamerkan kes "
"penggunaan rakan kongsi, dan memberikan peluang untuk soal jawab dengan "
"pakar kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the first segment, we will talk about the evolution coming to IBM Quantum"
" Platform that is designed to enhance security, stability, and user "
"experience. Our team will walk through the key updates, demonstrate new "
"capabilities, and discuss how these improvements empower developers and "
"users alike.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam segmen pertama, kami akan membincangkan evolusi yang akan datang "
"kepada IBM Quantum Platform yang direka untuk meningkatkan keselamatan, "
"kestabilan, dan pengalaman pengguna. Pasukan kami akan menelusuri kemas kini"
" utama, menunjukkan keupayaan baharu, dan membincangkan bagaimana "
"penambahbaikan ini memperkasakan pembangun dan pengguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The second segment will feature the launch of three new and innovative "
"Qiskit Functions in the Qiskit Functions Catalog. Each function provider "
"will present their solution, highlighting its unique features, use cases, "
"and impact on the broader ecosystem. Attendees will gain firsthand insights "
"into how these Qiskit Functions can be leveraged for real-world "
"applications.\n"
msgstr ""
"Segmen kedua akan menampilkan pelancaran tiga Fungsi Qiskit baharu dan "
"inovatif dalam Katalog Fungsi Qiskit. Setiap pembekal fungsi akan "
"membentangkan penyelesaian mereka, menyerlahkan ciri unik, kes penggunaan, "
"dan kesannya kepada ekosistem yang lebih luas. Peserta akan mendapat "
"pandangan terus tentang bagaimana Fungsi Qiskit ini boleh dimanfaatkan untuk"
" aplikasi dunia nyata.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Learn more and register "
"today](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Ketahui lebih lanjut dan daftar hari "
"ini](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "26 February 2025 {#26-february-2025}"
msgstr "26 Februari 2025 {#26-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Today, we are releasing an early access version of the upgraded experience, "
"and invite you to [open an account and explore the new "
"interface](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). We will continue to roll out "
"updates over the coming months, with the end goal of creating an experience "
"that looks and feels like the classic version of IBM Quantum Platform, but "
"with greater functionality. We will eventually sunset IBM Quantum Platform "
"classic, so stay tuned for updates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hari ini, kami sedang mengeluarkan versi akses awal pengalaman yang "
"ditingkatkan, dan menjemput anda untuk [membuka akaun dan meneroka antara "
"muka baharu](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Kami akan terus melancarkan "
"kemas kini dalam beberapa bulan akan datang, dengan matlamat akhir untuk "
"mencipta pengalaman yang kelihatan dan terasa seperti versi klasik IBM "
"Quantum Platform, tetapi dengan fungsi yang lebih besar. Kami akhirnya akan "
"menamatkan IBM Quantum Platform classic, jadi ikuti perkembangannya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Please note: If your IBM Quantum Platform access falls under a plan "
"administrator (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, etc.), you will "
"receive guided migration support through your administrator in the coming "
"months. In the meantime, you are welcome to [create a free Open Plan account"
" to explore the new platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ambil perhatian: Jika akses IBM Quantum Platform anda berada di bawah "
"pentadbir pelan (Pelan Premium, Pelan On-Prem, Program Permulaan, dsb.), "
"anda akan menerima sokongan migrasi berpandu melalui pentadbir anda dalam "
"beberapa bulan akan datang. Sementara itu, anda dialu-alukan untuk [mencipta"
" akaun Pelan Terbuka percuma untuk meneroka platform "
"baharu](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "24 February 2025 {#24-february-2025}"
msgstr "24 Februari 2025 {#24-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our inventory is getting a makeover, and we will be retiring the following "
"QPUs on or around 18 April 2025:\n"
msgstr ""
"Inventori kami sedang menjalani pembaharuan, dan kami akan menyarakan QPU "
"berikut pada atau sekitar 18 April 2025:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "ibm_kyiv\n"
msgstr "ibm_kyiv\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"~ibm_sherbrooke~ UPDATE: ibm_sherbrooke will stay active for several more "
"weeks after 18 April 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"~ibm_sherbrooke~ KEMAS KINI: ibm_sherbrooke akan kekal aktif selama beberapa"
" minggu lagi selepas 18 April 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before these QPUs are retired.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan anda mendapatkan semula data kerja daripada kerja terdahulu yang penting sebelum QPU ini bersara.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-sdk\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-sdk\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK v2.3 {#qiskit-sdk-v23}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026}"
msgstr "Januari 2026 {#january-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Building on the momentum established across the v2.x series, which has "
"centered on positioning Qiskit as the leading platform for hybrid quantum-"
"HPC workflows, [Qiskit SDK "
"v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) delivers "
"a significant expansion of the C API alongside faster, more flexible tools "
"for building and optimizing quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Membina momentum yang diwujudkan merentasi siri v2.x, yang berpusat pada "
"meletakkan Qiskit sebagai platform terkemuka untuk alur kerja hibrid "
"kuantum-HPC, [Qiskit SDK "
"v2.3](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) "
"menghasilkan pengembangan ketara C API bersama alat yang lebih pantas dan "
"lebih fleksibel untuk membina dan mengoptimumkan Circuit kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  Major updates include:\n"
msgstr "  Kemas kini utama merangkumi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom transpiler passes in C** - Write custom transpiler passes through "
"Qiskit's C API using the new `QkDag` object and an expanded `QkTarget` "
"object, which enable step-by-step inspection, modification, and extension of"
" the compilation process - without rebuilding the entire compiler "
"pipeline.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Lintasan Transpiler tersuai dalam C** - Tulis lintasan Transpiler tersuai "
"melalui C API Qiskit menggunakan objek `QkDag` baharu dan objek `QkTarget` "
"yang diperluaskan, yang membolehkan pemeriksaan langkah demi langkah, "
"pengubahsuaian, dan pengembangan proses kompilasi — tanpa membina semula "
"keseluruhan saluran paip pengkompil.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Faster hardware layout selection** - Upgrades and Rust-driven performance "
"enhancements to `VF2Layout` and `VF2PostLayout` improve the speed and "
"scalability of circuit-to-hardware layout selection, reducing compilation "
"overhead and improving fidelity on quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pemilihan susun atur perkakasan yang lebih pantas** - Naik taraf dan "
"peningkatan prestasi berasaskan Rust kepada `VF2Layout` dan `VF2PostLayout` "
"meningkatkan kelajuan dan kebolehskalaan pemilihan susun atur Circuit-ke-"
"perkakasan, mengurangkan overhed kompilasi dan meningkatkan ketepatan pada "
"perkakasan kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**New multi-qubit Pauli measurement** - The new `PauliProductMeasurement` "
"instruction enables joint projective measurement across multiple qubits in a"
" single operation, unlocking compilation to Pauli-based computation - a "
"common representation in fault-tolerant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengukuran Pauli berbilang Qubit baharu** - Arahan "
"`PauliProductMeasurement` baharu membolehkan pengukuran unjuran bersama "
"merentasi berbilang Qubit dalam satu operasi, membuka kompilasi ke pengiraan"
" berasaskan Pauli — perwakilan umum dalam pengkomputeran kuantum toleran "
"kesalahan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Improvements in early fault-tolerant transpilation** - Performance and "
"feature enhancements for transpilation to early fault-tolerant targets - "
"especially Clifford+T targets - help users more efficiently build "
"transpilation pipelines for future QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Penambahbaikan dalam transpilasi toleran kesalahan awal** - Peningkatan "
"prestasi dan ciri untuk transpilasi ke sasaran toleran kesalahan awal — "
"terutamanya sasaran Clifford+T — membantu pengguna membina saluran paip "
"transpilasi dengan lebih cekap untuk QPU masa hadapan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  These capabilities give developers greater flexibility to customize "
"quantum circuit optimizations and integrate with existing HPC workflows. "
"[Visit the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-"
"summary) for the full technical summary.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Keupayaan ini memberikan pembangun lebih fleksibiliti untuk menyesuaikan "
"pengoptimuman Circuit kuantum dan mengintegrasikan dengan alur kerja HPC "
"sedia ada. [Lawati "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-3-release-summary) untuk "
"ringkasan teknikal penuh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Wondering what has changed? Read the "
"[changelog](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) and the "
"[v2.3 release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-"
"notes/2.3).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tertanya-tanya apa yang telah berubah? Baca "
"[changelog](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/releases/tag/2.3.0) dan [nota "
"keluaran v2.3](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes/2.3).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* use url format /api/qiskit/release-notes/X.X to link to the specific X.X"
" version of the release notes */}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* use url format /api/qiskit/release-notes/X.X to link to the specific X.X"
" version of the release notes */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*To see the release notes for all versions, visit the [Qiskit SDK release "
"notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes).*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Untuk melihat nota keluaran bagi semua versi, lawati [nota keluaran Qiskit "
"SDK](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes).*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-runtime\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-runtime\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime client 0.46.0 {#qiskit-runtime-client-0460}"
msgstr "Klien Qiskit Runtime 0.46.0 {#qiskit-runtime-client-0460}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "April 2026 {#april-2026}"
msgstr "April 2026 {#april-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"executor-primitive\"></span>\n"
"- **Introducing the Executor primitive**: We're excited to announce the release of the new `Executor` primitive and a new version of the noise-learning helper class, `NoiseLearnerV3`, both of which were first previewed at QDC 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"executor-primitive\"></span>\n"
"- **Memperkenalkan primitif Executor**: Kami dengan gembira mengumumkan keluaran primitif `Executor` baharu dan versi baharu kelas pembantu pembelajaran hingar, `NoiseLearnerV3`, yang kedua-duanya pertama kali dipratonton di QDC 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Together with "
"[Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html), they make up"
" the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), which "
"provides full transparency and control to fine-tune your error mitigation "
"workflow. The [Probabilistic error cancellation with shaded "
"lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html) tutorial, for example, demonstrates "
"how this model is used to combine advanced techniques, including shaded "
"lightcones, probabilistic error cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error "
"eXtinction (TREX), and [measurement-based postselection](/guides/post-"
"selection), to further improve the result quality.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Bersama-sama dengan "
"[Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html), mereka "
"membentuk [model pelaksanaan terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model), "
"yang memberikan ketelusan dan kawalan penuh untuk melaraskan alur kerja "
"pengurangan ralat anda. Tutorial [Pembatalan ralat kebarangkalian dengan kon"
" cahaya berlorek](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html), sebagai contoh, menunjukkan "
"bagaimana model ini digunakan untuk menggabungkan teknik lanjutan, termasuk "
"kon cahaya berlorek, pembatalan ralat kebarangkalian (PEC), Twirled Readout "
"Error eXtinction (TREX), dan [pascapilihan berasaskan "
"pengukuran](/guides/post-selection), untuk meningkatkan lagi kualiti "
"keputusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If you prefer a higher level of abstraction, "
"[`EstimatorV2`](/guides/estimator-noise-management) in Qiskit Runtime "
"continues to provide several built-in error mitigation and suppression "
"techniques, which you can easily tune using the "
"[`resilience_level`](/guides/estimator-noise-management#resilience-level) "
"option.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Jika anda lebih suka tahap abstraksi yang lebih tinggi, "
"[`EstimatorV2`](/guides/estimator-noise-management) dalam Qiskit Runtime "
"terus menyediakan beberapa teknik pengurangan dan penindasan ralat terbina "
"dalam, yang boleh anda laraskan dengan mudah menggunakan pilihan "
"[`resilience_level`](/guides/estimator-noise-management#resilience-level).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  To learn more, see the following guides:\n"
msgstr "  Untuk mengetahui lebih lanjut, lihat panduan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Executor quickstart](/guides/get-started-with-executor)\n"
msgstr "[Mula pantas Executor](/guides/get-started-with-executor)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Noise learning helper](/guides/noise-learning)\n"
msgstr "[Pembantu pembelajaran hingar](/guides/noise-learning)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Both of these new features are currently in beta and require `qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime` version 0.47.0 or higher.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Kedua-dua ciri baharu ini kini dalam beta dan memerlukan `qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime` versi 0.47.0 atau lebih tinggi.\n"

