#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-runtime-service\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-runtime-service\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime service {#qiskit-runtime-service}"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime {#qiskit-runtime-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This summary of the latest changes to the Qiskit Runtime service applies to "
"anyone using Qiskit Runtime, regardless of how you communicate with the "
"service (by using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` or otherwise), or which version of "
"the client SDK you use.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ringkasan perubahan terkini kepada perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime ini terpakai "
"kepada sesiapa sahaja yang menggunakan Qiskit Runtime, tanpa mengira cara "
"anda berkomunikasi dengan perkhidmatan (dengan menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime` atau sebaliknya), atau versi SDK klien yang anda gunakan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026-1}"
msgstr "Januari 2026 {#january-2026-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[**Directed execution model.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) This new "
"execution model allows you to fine-tune error mitigation and other "
"techniques without sacrificing performance by providing the ingredients to "
"capture design intents on the client side, and shifting the costly "
"generation of circuit variants to the server side. For example, you can use "
"the [Samplomatic library](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) "
"to define the exact layers in your circuits to apply Pauli-twirling and to "
"inject noise. The new [Executor primitive](/guides/directed-execution-"
"model#executor-primitive) will then follow your directives to generate and "
"execute the randomized circuit variants in Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"[**Model pelaksanaan terarah.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) Model "
"pelaksanaan baharu ini membolehkan anda melaraskan dengan tepat pengurangan "
"ralat dan teknik lain tanpa mengorbankan prestasi dengan menyediakan bahan "
"untuk menangkap niat reka bentuk di sisi klien, dan mengalihkan penjanaan "
"variasi Circuit yang mahal ke sisi pelayan. Sebagai contoh, anda boleh "
"menggunakan [pustaka "
"Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) untuk "
"mentakrifkan lapisan tepat dalam Circuit anda untuk menggunakan Pauli-"
"twirling dan menyuntik hingar. Primitif [Executor](/guides/directed-"
"execution-model#executor-primitive) baharu kemudian akan mengikuti arahan "
"anda untuk menjana dan melaksanakan variasi Circuit rawak dalam Qiskit "
"Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Previous updates**\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Kemas kini sebelumnya**\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025-1}"
msgstr "Oktober 2025 {#october-2025-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The new dynamic circuits is now available to all users on all backends, "
"except some QPUs under the On-Prem Plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"Litar dinamik baharu kini tersedia kepada semua pengguna di semua Backend, "
"kecuali beberapa QPU di bawah Pelan On-Prem.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  With this new version, you can run dynamic circuits at utility scale. The "
"initial release offers the following features:\n"
msgstr ""
"  Dengan versi baharu ini, anda boleh menjalankan litar dinamik pada skala "
"utiliti. Keluaran awal menawarkan ciri-ciri berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "75x execution speedup, thanks to the latest quantum execution stack\n"
msgstr ""
"Pecutan pelaksanaan 75x, terima kasih kepada timbunan pelaksanaan kuantum "
"terbaru\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parallel branch execution, which reduces circuit duration and improves "
"result quality\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelaksanaan cawangan selari, yang mengurangkan tempoh Circuit dan "
"meningkatkan kualiti keputusan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for [classical "
"operations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) "
"defined in Qiskit, with the exception of bit shift and arithmetic\n"
msgstr ""
"Sokongan untuk [operasi "
"klasik](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) yang "
"ditakrifkan dalam Qiskit, kecuali anjakan bit dan aritmetik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for stretch duration in delay instructions. This new type allows "
"design intent to be captured at circuit construction time, and timing "
"resolution at compile time\n"
msgstr ""
"Sokongan untuk tempoh regang dalam arahan kelewatan. Jenis baharu ini "
"membolehkan niat reka bentuk ditangkap pada masa pembinaan Circuit, dan "
"resolusi masa pada masa kompilasi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  Additional features will be rolled out later this year.\n"
msgstr "  Ciri tambahan akan dilancarkan kemudian tahun ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  See  [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow) and [Deferred timing resolution using "
"stretch](/guides/stretch) for more information and code examples.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Lihat [Suapan balik klasik dan aliran kawalan](/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow) dan [Resolusi masa tertunda menggunakan "
"regang](/guides/stretch) untuk maklumat lanjut dan contoh kod.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025-1}"
msgstr "5 Jun 2025 {#5-june-2025-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now available: Early access to the new version of dynamic circuits on select"
" QPUs. This new version will allow you to run dynamic circuits at utility "
"scale and comes with improvements in speed, quality, and usability. Premium "
"Plan and Flex Plan users interested in participating in this early access "
"can [contact us](/guides/support).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini tersedia: Akses awal kepada versi baharu litar dinamik pada QPU "
"terpilih. Versi baharu ini akan membolehkan anda menjalankan litar dinamik "
"pada skala utiliti dan datang dengan penambahbaikan dalam kelajuan, kualiti,"
" dan kebolehgunaan. Pengguna Pelan Premium dan Pelan Flex yang berminat "
"untuk mengambil bahagian dalam akses awal ini boleh [menghubungi "
"kami](/guides/support).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3 February 2025 {#3-february-2025}"
msgstr "3 Februari 2025 {#3-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pulse-level control on all IBM Quantum processors has been removed.  "
"Additionally, the pulse module is scheduled for removal in Qiskit SDK v2.0."
"  Instead, you can use fractional gates that are now built into the "
"Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). For full details and help migrating your"
" code, refer to [Migrate from Qiskit Pulse to fractional "
"gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kawalan peringkat denyut pada semua pemproses IBM Quantum telah dialih "
"keluar. Selain itu, modul denyut dijadualkan untuk dialih keluar dalam "
"Qiskit SDK v2.0. Sebaliknya, anda boleh menggunakan Gate pecahan yang kini "
"dibina ke dalam Seni Bina Set Arahan (ISA). Untuk butiran penuh dan bantuan "
"memindahkan kod anda, rujuk [Berpindah daripada Qiskit Pulse ke Gate "
"pecahan](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"new-version-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"new-version-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2 February 2025 {#2-february-2025}"
msgstr "2 Februari 2025 {#2-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Starting 2 June 2025 and continuing through the year, IBM Quantum will begin a gradual rollout of new features to [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) that will enable them at the utility scale.\n"
"Improvements include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"- Bermula 2 Jun 2025 dan berterusan sepanjang tahun, IBM Quantum akan memulakan pelancaran beransur ciri baharu kepada [litar dinamik](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) yang akan membolehkannya pada skala utiliti.\n"
"Penambahbaikan merangkumi perkara berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A 75x speedup in execution by using the Gen3 engine stack\n"
msgstr "Pecutan pelaksanaan 75x dengan menggunakan timbunan enjin Gen3\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parallel execution of branches, which reduces circuit duration and improves "
"result quality\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelaksanaan selari cawangan, yang mengurangkan tempoh Circuit dan "
"meningkatkan kualiti keputusan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Improvement in mid-circuit measurement\n"
msgstr "Penambahbaikan dalam pengukuran pertengahan Circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Better integration with dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr "Integrasi yang lebih baik dengan penyahgandingan dinamik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "More visibility of circuit timing information\n"
msgstr "Lebih keterlihatan maklumat masa Circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To accelerate the rollout, the following capabilities are now deprecated and"
" will be no longer supported on or around 2 June 2025:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mempercepatkan pelancaran, keupayaan berikut kini ditamatkan dan tidak"
" lagi akan disokong pada atau sekitar 2 Jun 2025:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `while`, `for`, and `switch` control flow constructs\n"
msgstr "Konstruk aliran kawalan `while`, `for`, dan `switch`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The ability to use control flow instructions inside the body of a branch (as"
" in, nested control flow)\n"
msgstr ""
"Keupayaan menggunakan arahan aliran kawalan dalam badan cawangan (iaitu, "
"aliran kawalan bersarang)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Conditional measurements\n"
msgstr "Pengukuran bersyarat\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "7 January 2025 {#7-january-2025}"
msgstr "7 Januari 2025 {#7-january-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The rollout of the Gen3 engine stack begins today. This engine stack gives a"
" 75x speedup in execution.  The rollout will be done on one QPU at a time, "
"where a percentage of the jobs on the QPU will use the Gen3 path.  You can "
"also force the Gen3 path using the `gen3-turbo` experimental option. Note "
"that this engine stack is not compatible with fractional gates, pulse gates,"
" or dynamic circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelancaran timbunan enjin Gen3 bermula hari ini. Timbunan enjin ini "
"memberikan pecutan pelaksanaan 75x. Pelancaran akan dilakukan pada satu QPU "
"pada satu masa, di mana peratusan kerja pada QPU akan menggunakan laluan "
"Gen3. Anda juga boleh memaksa laluan Gen3 menggunakan pilihan eksperimental "
"`gen3-turbo`. Perhatikan bahawa timbunan enjin ini tidak serasi dengan Gate "
"pecahan, Gate denyut, atau litar dinamik.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 October 2024 {#15-october-2024}"
msgstr "15 Oktober 2024 {#15-october-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support for `backend.run` has ended.\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk `backend.run` telah tamat.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1 October 2024 {#1-october-2024}"
msgstr "1 Oktober 2024 {#1-october-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Parameterized delay gates have been deprecated.\n"
msgstr "Gate kelewatan berparameter telah ditamatkan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "15 August 2024 {#15-august-2024}"
msgstr "15 Ogos 2024 {#15-august-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now "
"available for Estimator V2. See the [`ZneOptions` API "
"reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-"
"options) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kaedah pengurangan ralat amplifikasi ralat kebarangkalian (PEA) kini "
"tersedia untuk Estimator V2. Lihat [rujukan API "
"`ZneOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-"
"zne-options) untuk butiran lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new helper program `noise-learner` is now available. It allows "
"characterizing the noise processes affecting the gates in one or more "
"circuits of interest, based on the Pauli-Lindblad noise model. The output "
"noise model can then be passed to Estimator via the `layer_noise_model` "
"option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Program pembantu baharu `noise-learner` kini tersedia. Ia membolehkan "
"pencirian proses hingar yang mempengaruhi Gate dalam satu atau lebih Circuit"
" yang diminati, berdasarkan model hingar Pauli-Lindblad. Model hingar output"
" kemudian boleh dihantar ke Estimator melalui pilihan `layer_noise_model`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "V1 primitives are no longer supported.\n"
msgstr "Primitif V1 tidak lagi disokong.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3 July 2024 {#3-july-2024}"
msgstr "3 Julai 2024 {#3-july-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following endpoints are deprecated and will be removed on or after 3 "
"October 2024: [`GET /stream/jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_jobs_state_updates)"
" and [`GET /stream/jobs/{id}`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_job_logs_jid). This "
"removal has the following impacts:\n"
msgstr ""
"Titik akhir berikut ditamatkan dan akan dialih keluar pada atau selepas 3 "
"Oktober 2024: [`GET /stream/jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_jobs_state_updates)"
" dan [`GET /stream/jobs/{id}`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/tags/jobs#tags__jobs__operations__get_stream_job_logs_jid). "
"Pengalihan keluar ini mempunyai kesan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the endpoints are removed, `job.stream_results()` and "
"`job.interim_results()` will be removed from the [qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) client.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas titik akhir dialih keluar, `job.stream_results()` dan "
"`job.interim_results()` akan dialih keluar daripada klien [qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional methods, such as `job.result()` currently use the deprecated "
"endpoints.  Upgrade to `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 or later before the "
"endpoints are removed to avoid disruption.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kaedah tambahan, seperti `job.result()` pada masa ini menggunakan titik "
"akhir yang ditamatkan. Naik taraf ke `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 atau lebih "
"baru sebelum titik akhir dialih keluar untuk mengelakkan gangguan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
