#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Transpiler Service client v0.3.0\n"
msgstr "Klien Perkhidmatan Transpiler Qiskit v0.3.0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - The Qiskit Transpiler Service leverages IBM Cloud&reg; resources to provide users with the latest transpilation capabilities from the Qiskit SDK. It offers a Python library that helps users seamlessly integrate the service into their current Qiskit patterns and workflows. Perhaps most importantly, the service invites users to experiment with new and improved AI-powered transpiler passes — cutting-edge tools that might be faster and produce better results than traditional transpilation methods. Read the [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/ai-transpiler-passes) for more information.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Perkhidmatan Transpiler Qiskit memanfaatkan sumber IBM Cloud&reg; untuk menyediakan pengguna dengan keupayaan transpilasi terkini daripada Qiskit SDK. Ia menawarkan pustaka Python yang membantu pengguna mengintegrasikan perkhidmatan dengan lancar ke dalam corak dan alur kerja Qiskit semasa mereka. Mungkin yang paling penting, perkhidmatan ini menjemput pengguna untuk bereksperimen dengan lintasan Transpiler berkuasa AI baharu dan bertambah baik — alat mutakhir yang mungkin lebih pantas dan menghasilkan keputusan yang lebih baik daripada kaedah transpilasi tradisional. Baca [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/ai-transpiler-passes) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-addons\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-addons\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Tambahan Qiskit {#qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recently released two new addons that use classical resources to reduce "
"the quantum resources needed for error mitigation:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami baru-baru ini mengeluarkan dua tambahan baharu yang menggunakan sumber "
"klasik untuk mengurangkan sumber kuantum yang diperlukan untuk pengurangan "
"ralat:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Propagated noise absorption (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"pna/) is a technique for mitigating errors in expectation values by "
"absorbing the inverses of the learned noise channels into observables using "
"Pauli propagation. \n"
msgstr ""
"[Penyerapan hingar teraruh (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"pna/) ialah teknik untuk mengurangkan ralat dalam nilai jangkaan dengan "
"menyerap songsangan saluran hingar yang dipelajari ke dalam kebolehcerap "
"menggunakan perambatan Pauli. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Shaded lightcones (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) "
"addon uses classical simulations to more tightly bound the sensitivity to "
"errors throughout the circuit. This allows for more efficient, targeted "
"applications of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) with reduced "
"variance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tambahan [Kon cahaya berlorek (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/) menggunakan simulasi klasik untuk membataskan sensitiviti terhadap "
"ralat sepanjang Circuit dengan lebih ketat. Ini membolehkan aplikasi "
"Pembatalan Ralat Kebarangkalian (PEC) yang lebih cekap dan disasarkan dengan"
" varian yang dikurangkan.\n"

