#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "18 July 2025 {#18-july-2025}"
msgstr "18 Julai 2025 {#18-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Functions templates provide you with a modular pipeline that allows "
"you to swap in new tools, methods, or configurations for your own custom "
"experiments. All function templates are also readily deployable to [Qiskit "
"Serverless](/guides/serverless), where you can easily leverage classical "
"compute as part of running your workflow. You can deploy your serverless "
"package on your preferred cloud environment, or take advantage of the hosted"
" service provided by IBM for Premium and Flex Plan users. Regardless of "
"which option you choose, Qiskit Serverless helps to simplify execution and "
"parallelize portions of your workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Templat Fungsi Qiskit menyediakan anda saluran paip modular yang membolehkan"
" anda menukar alatan, kaedah, atau konfigurasi baharu untuk eksperimen "
"tersuai anda sendiri. Semua templat fungsi juga boleh digunakan dengan mudah"
" ke [Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless), di mana anda boleh dengan mudah"
" memanfaatkan pengiraan klasik sebagai sebahagian daripada menjalankan alur "
"kerja anda. Anda boleh menggunakan pakej serverless anda pada persekitaran "
"cloud pilihan anda, atau memanfaatkan perkhidmatan yang dihoskan yang "
"disediakan oleh IBM untuk pengguna Pelan Premium dan Flex. Tanpa mengira "
"pilihan yang anda pilih, Qiskit Serverless membantu memudahkan pelaksanaan "
"dan memparalelkan bahagian alur kerja anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Visit the [Qiskit Functions templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates) "
"guide to learn more, or read an overview of [Qiskit "
"Functions](/guides/functions) in the documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lawati panduan [Templat Fungsi Qiskit](/guides/qiskit-function-templates) "
"untuk mengetahui lebih lanjut, atau baca gambaran keseluruhan [Fungsi "
"Qiskit](/guides/functions) dalam dokumentasi.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025-2}"
msgstr "5 Jun 2025 {#5-june-2025-2}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We're excited to roll out two new functions for finance and optimization:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami dengan gembira melancarkan dua fungsi baharu untuk kewangan dan "
"pengoptimuman:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[QUICK-PDE](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=colibritd-quick-pde) "
"by ColibriTD allows users to solve certain differential equations for "
"material deformation and computational fluid dynamics problems. For example,"
" one team of researchers has already begun using the QUICK-PDE function to "
"study the dynamics of novel reactive fluids developed to transfer heat more "
"efficiently in a type of nuclear reactor known as Small Modular Reactors.\n"
msgstr ""
"[QUICK-PDE](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=colibritd-quick-pde) "
"oleh ColibriTD membolehkan pengguna menyelesaikan persamaan pembezaan "
"tertentu untuk masalah ubah bentuk bahan dan dinamik bendalir pengiraan. "
"Sebagai contoh, satu pasukan penyelidik telah mula menggunakan fungsi QUICK-"
"PDE untuk mengkaji dinamik bendalir reaktif baharu yang dibangunkan untuk "
"memindahkan haba dengan lebih cekap dalam jenis reaktor nuklear yang "
"dikenali sebagai Reaktor Modular Kecil.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Quantum Portfolio "
"Optimizer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=global-data-quantum-"
"quantum-portfolio-optimizer) by Global Data Quantum enables quantitative "
"finance researchers to back-test portfolio optimization strategies. Running "
"on over 100 qubits, this function calculates a portfolio's Sharpe ratio "
"versus return across a specified time period. Early users are exploring the "
"optimizer's ability to evaluate historical performance of an investment "
"strategy and to enable comparisons of different portfolios under similar "
"conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Pengoptimum Portfolio "
"Kuantum](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions?id=global-data-quantum-"
"quantum-portfolio-optimizer) oleh Global Data Quantum membolehkan penyelidik"
" kewangan kuantitatif menguji semula strategi pengoptimuman portfolio. "
"Berjalan pada lebih 100 Qubit, fungsi ini mengira nisbah Sharpe portfolio "
"berbanding pulangan merentasi tempoh masa yang ditentukan. Pengguna awal "
"meneroka keupayaan pengoptimum untuk menilai prestasi sejarah strategi "
"pelaburan dan untuk membolehkan perbandingan portfolio yang berbeza dalam "
"keadaan yang serupa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check out the [Qiskit Functions "
"Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) to request a free trial "
"today.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat [Katalog Fungsi Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) untuk"
" meminta percubaan percuma hari ini.\n"

