#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "16 September 2024 {#16-september-2024}"
msgstr "16 September 2024 {#16-september-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introducing the Qiskit Functions preview, for IBM Quantum Premium Plan "
"users. To get started, `pip install qiskit-ibm-catalog` and explore the "
"[Qiskit Functions documentation](/guides/functions). With the Qiskit "
"Functions Catalog client, you can submit workloads to abstracted services "
"designed to accelerate your research. Sign in with your existing IBM Quantum"
" Platform credentials.\n"
msgstr ""
"Memperkenalkan pratonton Fungsi Qiskit, untuk pengguna Pelan Premium IBM "
"Quantum. Untuk memulakan, `pip install qiskit-ibm-catalog` dan terokai "
"[dokumentasi Fungsi Qiskit](/guides/functions). Dengan klien Katalog Fungsi "
"Qiskit, anda boleh menghantar beban kerja ke perkhidmatan yang "
"diabstraksikan yang direka untuk mempercepatkan penyelidikan anda. Log masuk"
" dengan bukti kelayakan IBM Quantum Platform sedia ada anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The Qiskit Functions Catalog preview provides access to Premium Plan users"
" to explore the available functions, including those written by IBM and "
"those written by other members of our ecosystem. The catalog contains two "
"kinds of functions: circuit functions and application functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Pratonton Katalog Fungsi Qiskit menyediakan akses kepada pengguna Pelan "
"Premium untuk meneroka fungsi yang tersedia, termasuk yang ditulis oleh IBM "
"dan yang ditulis oleh ahli ekosistem kami yang lain. Katalog mengandungi dua"
" jenis fungsi: fungsi Circuit dan fungsi aplikasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Circuit functions** provide a simplified interface for running circuits. "
"They receive user-provided abstract circuits and observables as input, then "
"manage synthesis, optimization, and execution of the representative ISA "
"circuit. Circuit functions bring together the latest capabilities in "
"transpilation, error suppression, and error mitigation to make utility-grade"
" performance accessible out of the box. This allows computational scientists"
" to focus on mapping their problems to circuits, rather than building the "
"pattern for each problem from scratch.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Fungsi Circuit** menyediakan antara muka yang dipermudah untuk menjalankan"
" Circuit. Mereka menerima Circuit abstrak dan kebolehcerap yang disediakan "
"pengguna sebagai input, kemudian mengurus sintesis, pengoptimuman, dan "
"pelaksanaan Circuit ISA yang mewakilinya. Fungsi Circuit menyatukan "
"keupayaan terkini dalam transpilasi, penindasan ralat, dan pengurangan ralat"
" untuk menjadikan prestasi gred utiliti mudah diakses secara pra-"
"konfigurasi. Ini membolehkan saintis pengiraan memberi tumpuan kepada "
"pemetaan masalah mereka ke Circuit, bukannya membina corak untuk setiap "
"masalah dari awal.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Application functions** cover higher-level tasks, like exploring "
"algorithms and domain-specific use cases. Enterprise developers and data "
"scientists may not have the background quantum information science knowledge"
" for working with circuits, and instead hope to bring their domain knowledge"
" to advance quantum computing algorithms and applications. With application "
"functions, users can enter their classical inputs and receive solutions so "
"they can more easily experiment with plugging quantum into their domain-"
"specific workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Fungsi aplikasi** merangkumi tugas peringkat lebih tinggi, seperti "
"meneroka algoritma dan kes penggunaan khusus domain. Pembangun perusahaan "
"dan saintis data mungkin tidak mempunyai latar belakang sains maklumat "
"kuantum untuk bekerja dengan Circuit, dan sebaliknya berharap untuk membawa "
"pengetahuan domain mereka untuk memajukan algoritma dan aplikasi "
"pengkomputeran kuantum. Dengan fungsi aplikasi, pengguna boleh memasukkan "
"input klasik mereka dan menerima penyelesaian supaya mereka boleh "
"bereksperimen dengan lebih mudah dalam mengintegrasikan kuantum ke dalam "
"alur kerja khusus domain mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With the launch of the Qiskit Functions Catalog, Premium Plan developers can"
" explore the IBM Circuit function. The IBM Circuit function includes the "
"latest AI-powered extensions to Qiskit for circuit synthesis, optimization, "
"and scheduling, as well as advanced error mitigation methods to return the "
"most accurate estimations possible with today's hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan pelancaran Katalog Fungsi Qiskit, pembangun Pelan Premium boleh "
"meneroka fungsi Circuit IBM. Fungsi Circuit IBM merangkumi sambungan "
"berkuasa AI terbaru kepada Qiskit untuk sintesis Circuit, pengoptimuman, dan"
" penjadualan, serta kaedah pengurangan ralat lanjutan untuk mengembalikan "
"anggaran yang paling tepat yang mungkin dengan perkakasan hari ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Users can purchase licenses for the following functions contributed by our"
" partners at Q-CTRL, QEDMA, and Algorithmiq.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Pengguna boleh membeli lesen untuk fungsi-fungsi berikut yang disumbangkan"
" oleh rakan kongsi kami di Q-CTRL, QEDMA, dan Algorithmiq.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit functions**\n"
msgstr "**Fungsi Circuit**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Q-CTRL is releasing a circuit function that applies AI-driven quantum "
"control techniques, with which users can scale successfully to larger "
"problems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Q-CTRL mengeluarkan fungsi Circuit yang menggunakan teknik kawalan kuantum "
"dipacu AI, dengan mana pengguna boleh berskala dengan berjaya kepada masalah"
" yang lebih besar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Algorithmiq is releasing a circuit function that applies TEM (tensor-network"
" error mitigation), an error mitigation method for obtaining estimators with"
" fewer shots than the PEC (probabilistic error cancellation) method.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algorithmiq mengeluarkan fungsi Circuit yang menggunakan TEM (tensor-network"
" error mitigation), kaedah pengurangan ralat untuk memperoleh penganggir "
"dengan lebih sedikit shot berbanding kaedah PEC (probabilistic error "
"cancellation).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"QEDMA is releasing a circuit function that uses proprietary protocols for "
"efficient and accurate characterization of the noisy QPU operations, and "
"applies error suppression and error mitigation based on the characterization"
" data.\n"
msgstr ""
"QEDMA mengeluarkan fungsi Circuit yang menggunakan protokol proprietari "
"untuk pencirian cekap dan tepat operasi QPU yang berhingar, dan menggunakan "
"penindasan ralat dan pengurangan ralat berdasarkan data pencirian.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Application functions**\n"
msgstr "**Fungsi aplikasi**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Q-CTRL is releasing an optimization solver with which users can pass a graph"
" or an objective, and receive solution costs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Q-CTRL mengeluarkan penyelesai pengoptimuman yang membolehkan pengguna "
"menghantar graf atau objektif, dan menerima kos penyelesaian.\n"

